#note "TRT01A, the operator's TARGET and the rule's single Requirements.Variables.All entry, is absent. TRTxxAN matches TRT01AN so the template DOES expand (xx=01) and TRTxxA is synthesised as the absent TRT01A; the expansion rewrites Requirements.Variables.All to ['TRT01A'], which is absent, so the rule is reported not executed. NOT a wildcard NoMatch -- one column matched."
#library standard=adamig version=1-0
dataset ADSL
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col TRT01AN type=Num
